sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor User as Desktop User
    participant OS as Operating System
    participant Main as Electron Main Process
    participant Preload as Preload (ContextBridge)
    participant Renderer as Renderer (Vue 3 UI)

    User->>OS: Launch VRMMotionGeneration Application
    OS->>Main: Execute Electron main binary (src/main/index.ts)
    Main->>Main: Configure Security Policies (CSP, Navigation guards, Frame checks)
    Main->>Main: Register typed IPC handlers (app:get-version, app:get-diagnostics, app:ping)
    Main->>OS: Instantiate BrowserWindow with webPreferences (contextIsolation: true, nodeIntegration: false, sandbox: true)
    Main->>Preload: Load preload script (src/preload/index.ts)
    Preload->>Preload: Build typed DesktopAPI interface
    Preload->>Renderer: contextBridge.exposeInMainWorld('desktopAPI', desktopAPI)
    Main->>Renderer: Load renderer index.html
    Renderer->>Renderer: Mount Vue 3 application (@vrm/ui)
    Renderer->>Preload: window.desktopAPI.getDiagnostics()
    Preload->>Main: ipcRenderer.invoke('app:get-diagnostics')
    Main->>Main: Gather OS, memory, and architecture metrics
    Main-->>Preload: Return verified DiagnosticsInfo
    Preload-->>Renderer: Return typed object to Vue reactive store
    Renderer-->>User: Render Desktop Foundation UI with verified diagnostic status
